# Cloudflare Pages response headers (STS-015).
# Format: a path pattern, then indented "Name: value" lines. All matching rules apply.
#
# The CSP ships as Report-Only first: watch the browser console / reports, then
# promote it to Content-Security-Policy once nothing legitimate is flagged.
# Origins in use: Google Maps embed (Contact),
# avatar images (SolutionDetails), the backend API (VITE_API_URL). The AI
# provider is never called from the browser, so it is deliberately absent.
# Fonts are self-hosted (STS-048): woff2 under /assets/, no Google font origin.

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://i.pravatar.cc; connect-src 'self' https://*.sarayatechsolutions.com; frame-src https://www.google.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
